1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
혹시 나만 뒤처진 것 같았나요?
Did you ever feel like you were the only one falling behind?

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:07,363
이언 맥클라렌은 말했어요.
Ian Maclaren wrote,

3
00:00:07,463 --> 00:00:15,584
누구나 힘든 싸움 중이니 서로를 가엾게 여기라고.
"Be pitiful, for every man is fighting a hard battle."

4
00:00:15,684 --> 00:00:23,500
사진 속 친구도, 어젯밤엔 한숨 쉬었을 거예요.
Even your friend in that photo
may have sighed alone last night.

5
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:30,000
사진에 안 나온 하루에선, 우리 다 같은 편이에요.
On the days that aren't in the photos,
we're all on the same side.
